# 文本统一用 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# 媒体与字体：二进制，不做 diff
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.mov  binary
*.webm binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.ogg  binary
*.glb  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.gz   binary
*.zip  binary

# 暂不启用 Git LFS（整库约 50MB，单文件最大 8MB）。
# 当单文件超过 50MB 或仓库超过 1GB 时，先装 git-lfs，再把对应行改成：
#   *.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
